<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<title>Responsive CSS3 Webpage</title>

<!-- Google Font -->
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@300;400;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

<!-- Font Awesome Icons -->
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.0/css/all.min.css">

<style>

* {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
}

/* Navbar */
nav {
    background: #222;
    color: white;
    padding: 15px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
}

nav h2 {
    letter-spacing: 2px;
}

nav ul {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
}

nav ul li {
    margin: 0 15px;
}

nav ul li a {
    color: white;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: 0.3s;
}

nav ul li a:hover {
    color: #00adb5;
}

/* Hero Section */
.hero {
    height: 90vh;
    background: linear-gradient(to right, #00adb5, #393e46);
    color: white;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
    flex-direction: column;
    animation: fadeIn 2s ease-in;
}

.hero h1 {
    font-size: 3rem;
}

.hero p {
    margin-top: 10px;
}

/* Button */
.btn {
    margin-top: 20px;
    padding: 10px 25px;
    background: white;
    color: #333;
    border: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: transform 0.3s;
}

.btn:hover {
    transform: scale(1.1);
}

/* Multi-column section */
.columns {
    padding: 40px;
    column-count: 3;
    column-gap: 20px;
}

.columns p {
    margin-bottom: 15px;
}

/* Cards Section */
.cards {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 40px;
}

.card {
    width: 280px;
    margin: 15px;
    padding: 20px;
    background: #f4f4f4;
    border-radius: 10px;
    text-align: center;
    transition: transform 0.4s;
}

.card i {
    font-size: 40px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    color: #00adb5;
}

.card:hover {
    transform: rotate(5deg) scale(1.05);
}

/* Footer */
footer {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 20px;
    background: #222;
    color: white;
}

/* Animation */
@keyframes fadeIn {
    from {
        opacity: 0;
        transform: translateY(-50px);
    }
    to {
        opacity: 1;
        transform: translateY(0);
    }
}

/* Responsive Design */
@media(max-width: 768px) {
    .columns {
        column-count: 1;
    }

    nav ul {
        flex-direction: column;
    }

    .cards {
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: center;
    }
}

</style>
</head>

<body>

<!-- Navbar -->
<nav>
    <h2>MySite</h2>
    <ul>
        <li><a href="#">Home</a></li>
        <li><a href="#">Features</a></li>
        <li><a href="#">Contact</a></li>
    </ul>
</nav>

<!-- Hero Section -->
<section class="hero">
    <h1>Modern Responsive Design</h1>
    <p>Using CSS3 Features & Animations</p>
    <button class="btn">Explore</button>
</section>

<!-- Multi Column Content -->
<section class="columns">
    <p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Vivamus lacinia.</p>
    <p>Integer nec odio. Praesent libero. Sed cursus ante dapibus diam.</p>
    <p>Sed nisi. Nulla quis sem at nibh elementum imperdiet.</p>
    <p>Duis sagittis ipsum. Praesent mauris.</p>
    <p>Fusce nec tellus sed augue semper porta.</p>
    <p>Mauris massa. Vestibulum lacinia arcu eget nulla.</p>
</section>

<!-- Cards Section -->
<section class="cards">
    <div class="card">
        <i class="fas fa-code"></i>
        <h3>Development</h3>
        <p>Clean and efficient coding practices.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
        <i class="fas fa-paint-brush"></i>
        <h3>Design</h3>
        <p>Creative and modern UI designs.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
        <i class="fas fa-mobile-alt"></i>
        <h3>Responsive</h3>
        <p>Works on all devices smoothly.</p>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- Footer -->
<footer>
    <p>© 2026 Responsive Web Design</p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
